@foolip
I think this PR is enough to match reality of `size` `cols` and `rows`.
It's not impossible to add `field-sizing` behaviors with keeping presentational hints of `width` `height` and user-agent-level stylesheet rule of `width` `height`.  But I am reluctant to extend the incorrect definition further.

@zcorpan
The difference of presentational hint and UA style doesn't matter in this PR.  It's "presentational hints / UA style" vs. "intrinsic size".
